  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "Indican la direcci\xF3n para avanzar, retroceder, girar a la derecha o
      a la izquierda. Giras sobre la misma alfombrilla, pero sin avanzar."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: English
    Text: They indicate the direction to move forward, go backward, or turn right
      and left. You turn on the mat itself without moving forward
    Object: {fileID: 0}
